  "summary": "Theodora, daughter of a Hippodrome bear-keeper, married Justinian in 525 and was crowned empress alongside him in 527. She was empress during the Nika revolt in Constantinople in January 532 and died on 28 June 548, probably of cancer. Sources place her birth between c. 497 and c. 500.",
